-- Seed: production custom_roles (captured from new-prod "optishfnnctrhffpoywg" on 2026-08-24)
-- 20 active roles. Idempotent + non-destructive: inserts a role only when
-- NEITHER its id NOR its name already exists (both are UNIQUE), so it is safe to run
-- on the source env (no-op), a fresh/reset env (full seed with exact ids), or an env
-- that already has some of these roles (skips those, never errors). Does NOT update or
-- delete existing roles.

